OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 MAR
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GThe Elmore Quartet and Vista
OL,6,     GQuartet perform live ahead of
OL,7,     Gtheir performance at the
OL,8,     GGuildhall Chamber Festival. Also,
OL,9,     GMichael Waldron talks to Katie
OL,10,     GDerham about Britten and Oldham.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GCellist Laura van der Heijden
OL,16,     Gteams up with Sinfonia Cymru for
OL,17,     Ga thrilling programme of folk-
OL,18,     Ginspired music for strings,
OL,19,     Gincluding Dobrinka Tabakova's
OL,20,     GCello Concerto.
