OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 MAR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,5,     GKenneth Steven combines Scottish
OL,6,     Glandscape and geological history
OL,7,     Gwith his own poetry. In this
OL,8,     GEssay he searches for the elusive
OL,9,     Gblue of aquamarine.
OL,10,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,11,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Geverything in between.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GSoweto is back with more of the
OL,18,     Gbest in jazz from the UK and
OL,19,     Garound the world.
